No I meant doing it per mcp server like this:
```
  "jira-mcp": {
    "type": "remote",
    "url": "https://.../mcp/",
    "timeout": 60000,
    "enabled": true,
    "headers": {
      "Authorization": "Token {env:JIRA_PAT}"
    },
    "oauth": false
  }
```
